; An account with only a close directive is not reported, even where it is
; used; an account used before its open is not reported either.
2024-01-01 close Assets:Closed
2024-01-03 open Expenses:Late

2024-01-02 * "Uses the closed account"
  Assets:Closed   -1 EUR
  Expenses:Other   1 EUR

2024-01-02 * "Uses an account before its open"
  Expenses:Late    1 EUR
  Equity:Opening  -1 EUR

2024-01-03 balance Assets:Closed -1 EUR
